BindingTargetView.description:
The one target object of every read: slot reads, candidates and API-key
`bindingDefaults`. `address` and `label` are `null` where none;
`chains` is `[]` for a bank destination.

oneOf.description:
The protocol product this leg runs (`cctp`, `acrossBridge`, …), from the served route;
absent on a venue-account leg or when the route does not name it. Never parsed out of
`venue.name`, which is display text.
